# NOT ignored: tools/questions_*_raw.json are the pipeline's reset point.
# enhance_schema.py rewrites questions_*.json IN PLACE and is not
# idempotent — running it twice duplicates every condition it adds. The
# documented workflow starts by copying the raw file over the enhanced
# one, so the raw files have to be in the repo for a fresh clone to
# rebuild the schema at all.

